::  glurff-remote: agent -> agent, over Ames.
::
::  NOUN ONLY, deliberately. A browser must never poke this: the receiver takes
::  the subject from src.bowl, and an Eyre-reachable mark would let a page claim
::  to be someone else's presence, hosting or dice roll.
::
::  A cross-ship poke needs its mark on the RECEIVING desk -- Gall builds the
::  dais there to validate the vase. Local agent-to-agent pokes do not, which is
::  why a missing mark of this kind only shows up once two ships actually talk.
/-  g=glurff
|_  rem=remote:g
++  grab
  |%
  ++  noun  remote:g
  --
++  grow
  |%
  ++  noun  rem
  --
++  grad  %noun
--
